<title>USA: Finney County, Kan., won by Stern Brothers.</title>
<headline>Finney County, Kan., won by Stern Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stern Brothers &amp; Co said it won $1.25 million of Finney County, Kan., public building general obligation bonds, Series D, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.5256 percent.</p>
